    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔρῑς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ινος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a good nose</i>, i. e.
