				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνὸς . . ὥς τις εὔρινος βάσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			 (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔρινος</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
