				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1093
				</span></i>
			; late 
				Ep.
			 dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋρρίνεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.357
				</span></i>
			.</div>
